// Two scenarios (ticket #66): one Order on its happy path and one
// Reconciliation pass. Actors are the container view's components. Each step's
// note names the Order state reached; the state machine itself is a table on
// the Operator guide's orders page, not a diagram.
views {
  dynamic view order-flow {
    title 'Order, happy path'
    description '
      One Order from Quote to shipped. The Printfile is validated before the
      Checkout session exists; every webhook is verified, recorded as an
      Inbound Event and re-fetched before the Order moves.
    '

    customer -> pressline.app.storefront 'opens the Design on the Storefront, chooses an Offer, variant and country' {
      notes 'No Order yet. The Storefront shows the Quote: the fixed retail price of the Offer plus the shipping rate for the country (ADR-0010).'
    }
    pressline.app.storefront -> pressline.app.httpApi 'asks for the Design and the Quote over /api/*' {
      notes 'No Order yet.'
    }
    pressline.app.httpApi -> engine.app 'fetches the Design: Sellable, Preview, Eligibility' {
      notes 'DesignSource over @pressline/contract. A non-sellable Design refuses to quote. No Order yet.'
    }
    pressline.app.httpApi -> engine.app 'requests the Printfile for the Spec Hash and validates it' {
      notes 'Headers only, never pixels (ADR-0002). Synchronous, or 202 until the Engine has rendered (ADR-0005). No Order yet: nothing is written until the Printfile is valid.'
    }
    pressline.app.httpApi -> psp 'creates the Checkout session, Printfile URL already validated' {
      notes 'Order **checkout_open**, Cause `storefront`. No session exists without a validated Printfile (ADR-0004).'
    }
    customer -> psp 'pays on the hosted Checkout page' {
      notes 'Tax is added by the PSP; the Recipient is entered there and copied onto the Order. Still **checkout_open** until the webhook is processed.'
    }
    psp -> pressline.app.webhooks 'checkout.session.completed' {
      notes 'A hint about which session changed, never the truth (ADR-0007). Still **checkout_open**.'
    }
    pressline.app.webhooks -> pressline.ledger 'records the Inbound Event, signature verified' {
      notes 'Keyed by the event ID the PSP assigned, so a redelivery is processed at most once. Still **checkout_open**.'
    }
    pressline.app.webhooks -> psp 're-fetches the session' {
      notes 'The re-fetched session is the truth the Transition is based on. Still **checkout_open**.'
    }
    pressline.app.webhooks -> pressline.ledger 'Transition, Cause stripe_webhook' {
      notes 'Order **paid** (ADR-0009).'
    }
    pressline.app.webhooks -> fulfilmentProvider 'submits the provider order with the Printfile URL' {
      notes 'Order **submitted**. The Fulfilment Provider fetches the Printfile from the FileStore of the Engine, possibly months later (ADR-0003).'
    }
    pressline.app.webhooks -> mailer 'order confirmation with the Withdrawal Notice' {
      notes 'Still **submitted**.'
    }
    fulfilmentProvider -> pressline.app.webhooks 'provider order status' {
      notes 'A hint, like every webhook. Still **submitted**.'
    }
    pressline.app.webhooks -> pressline.ledger 'records the Inbound Event, signature verified' {
      notes 'Still **submitted**.'
    }
    pressline.app.webhooks -> fulfilmentProvider 're-fetches the provider order' {
      notes 'Still **submitted**.'
    }
    pressline.app.webhooks -> pressline.ledger 'Transition, Cause printful_webhook' {
      notes 'Order **in_production**. The next status webhook repeats the same three steps and moves the Order to **shipped**.'
    }
    pressline.app.webhooks -> mailer 'shipped with tracking' {
      notes 'Order **shipped**. A later status from the Fulfilment Provider moves it to **fulfilled**.'
    }
  }

  dynamic view reconciliation {
    title 'Reconciliation, one pass'
    description '
      The other half of "webhooks are hints": what happens when one never
      arrives. Every open Order is compared with the PSP and the Fulfilment
      Provider; anything missed becomes a Transition with Cause reconciliation.
    '

    operator -> pressline.app.reconciliation 'the platform scheduler fires, or the Operator runs `pressline reconcile`' {
      notes 'Cloudflare Cron Trigger or Vercel Cron on schedule; `pressline reconcile` or the Operator View, through the operator API, on demand.'
    }
    pressline.app.reconciliation -> pressline.ledger 'reads every open Order'
    pressline.app.reconciliation -> psp 're-fetches stale Checkout sessions; checks payment status for refunds' {
      notes 'A stale `checkout_open` that was paid becomes **paid** and is submitted; one that was not becomes **expired**. Refunds and disputes are recorded.'
    }
    pressline.app.reconciliation -> fulfilmentProvider 're-fetches each provider order' {
      notes 'A stuck **paid** Order is submitted again; **submitted**, **in_production** and **on_hold** move to what the provider reports.'
    }
    pressline.app.reconciliation -> pressline.ledger 'writes a Transition for anything the webhooks missed' {
      notes 'Cause `reconciliation`, always (ADR-0009). Unsettled Inbound Events are reprocessed, failed emails retried.'
    }
    pressline.app.reconciliation -> mailer 'Alarms for the Operator' {
      notes 'Only when there are any: a quiet night sends nothing.'
    }
    mailer -> operator 'Alarm email'
  }
}
